  "limitations": [
    "Validated execution covers count-backed point/spot tables with finite two-dimensional coordinates, sample-isolated generic-neighbor graphs, annotated neighborhood enrichment, sample-level co-occurrence, Moran-based spatial candidates and exploratory expression-spatial Leiden domains. Replicated spatial-gene status requires at least two independent biological samples; the public SeqFISH case has one embryo and therefore validates execution and within-embryo structure only. Platform-specific segmentation, image feature extraction, deconvolution, 3D geometry, continuous spatial models and sample-level condition inference require additional project-specific modules or code. The module records image and shape provenance but does not alter source imagery and requires a compatible project-approved scientific runtime."
